{"id":"2ff75bf9c7039be0","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-lefschetz.md","title":"Lefschetz Fixed Point Theorem","display":"thm-lefschetz — Lefschetz Fixed Point Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-lefschetz","aliases":["58-thm-lefschetz"],"display":"thm-lefschetz — Lefschetz Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-lefschetz-number-data.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-lefschetz"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-lefschetz</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lefschetz — Lefschetz Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4d7921597565c97\" href=\"?note=b4d7921597565c97\" title=\"58-df-lefschetz-number-data.md\">58-df-lefschetz-number-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-homology.md\">../batch08/58-df-homology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a061d5c71f82e51\" href=\"?note=3a061d5c71f82e51\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md\">../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,V_K,h,f,X,\\tau_X,\\ell\\in V\">\\(K,V_K,h,f,X,\\tau_X,\\ell\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\">\\(\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{|K|}=\\tau_K\">\\(\\tau_{|K|}=\\tau_K\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_K\">\\(\\tau_K\\)</span> 是 Lefschetz 数依赖中给出的有限几何实现拓扑；不是任意另选的拓扑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(h,|K|,\\tau_{|K|},X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(h,|K|,\\tau_{|K|},X,\\tau_X)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\\)</span> 使用内部依赖的闭链基、模边界矩阵和交错迹定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lefschetz\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(h,|K|,\\tau_{|K|},X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\n\\land\\ell\\neq0\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\bigl(f(x)=x\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lefschetz\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(h,|K|,\\tau_{|K|},X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\n\\land\\ell\\neq0\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\bigl(f(x)=x\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留非零 Lefschetz 数推出不动点这一结论；仅展开此前未定义的数值关系，并绑定几何实现的拓扑。</li>\n<li>矩阵和同调基是可消去的构造见证，不作为定理结论的额外输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-lefschetz-number-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4d7921597565c97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lefschetz-number-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-homology.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,V_K,h,f,X,\\tau_X,\\ell\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{|K|}=\\tau_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(h,|K|,\\tau_{|K|},X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lefschetz\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(h,|K|,\\tau_{|K|},X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\n\\land\\ell\\neq0\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\bigl(f(x)=x\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-lefschetz.md|58-thm-lefschetz]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["b4d7921597565c97","d9f6d19a1e737076","3a061d5c71f82e51","d9a25b0ac94a3598","3cd1834de4f2efb2","c4b4a825f2ea608d"]}